813
01:06:40,749 --> 01:06:51,775
And then the Community Development Board does a and our plans and acts under the subdivision control law, they would make recommendations on zoning amendments.

814
01:06:52,635 --> 01:06:54,616
and they also have site plan review authority.

815
01:06:54,936 --> 01:07:02,820
And the reason I asked for a site plan review is while that has become a zoning concept, it doesn't live in the zoning act itself.

816
01:07:02,940 --> 01:07:04,820
It's usually a product of a local bylaw.

817
