01:37:39,937 --> 01:37:40,298
So, um,

1086
01:37:43,391 --> 01:37:51,273
Plan conditions, if a special permit application is accompanied by a plan or there's specific work that are done, you want to include those as conditions.

1087
01:37:51,854 --> 01:38:01,817
So I'm sure you know this, but oftentimes in the decision, I'll say that the work needs to be consistent with a particular plan or in substantial compliance with a particular plan.

1088
01:38:01,837 --> 01:38:05,798
