1276
01:56:40,027 --> 01:56:44,089
the type of work the Zoning Board does doesn't trigger too many of the exceptions.

1277
01:56:44,910 --> 01:56:53,375
Emails are public records, texts are public records, really any writing in which there's communication is a public record.

1278
01:56:53,455 --> 01:57:02,861
