1285
01:57:57,678 --> 01:58:01,940
Yeah, so you might want to think about setting up like zoning board emails.

1286
01:58:03,338 --> 01:58:05,081
so that you just can keep things separate.

1287
01:58:05,482 --> 01:58:07,766
