Reminds us of the agenda.

1434
02:10:31,063 --> 02:10:34,045
Yeah, Dennis, I think it's perfectly reasonable.

1435
02:10:34,065 --> 02:10:35,046
I don't know.

1436
02:10:35,546 --> 02:10:38,608
Maybe if we took it to the logical extreme, it would be a problem.

1437
02:10:39,946 --> 02:10:50,770
It's fine having agenda items or like categories on there, but but yeah, I just am more comfortable if we at least acknowledge they were on there and then just, you know, even if it's nothing.

1438
02:10:52,051 --> 02:11:04,696
It's good of you to ask that, though, because every time people different I've worked with a bunch of committees and when they ask me for administrative updates, my brain racks and then I go, oh, you all would be interested to just just so you're aware.

1439
