1442
02:11:16,579 --> 02:11:23,921
I'm technically on vacation this week, but I do believe I saw something in my email about starting to do some interviewing.

1443
02:11:23,961 --> 02:11:26,942
You're on vacation and you came to hang out with us on a Thursday night?

1444
02:11:26,982 --> 02:11:27,882
That was very nice of you.

1445
02:11:28,462 --> 02:11:32,023
I really wanted to see the training myself and be here during it.

1446
