1447
02:11:36,076 --> 02:11:38,037
How did your daughter do in synchronized swimming?

1448
02:11:38,938 --> 02:11:42,441
They actually did amazingly well.

1449
02:11:42,641 --> 02:11:51,409
Her team, which is Cambridge Synchro, but it draws from the Cambridge, greater Cambridge area, including Medford, placed sixth in the nation.

1450
02:11:51,869 --> 02:11:52,430
Wow.

1451
02:11:52,550 --> 02:11:52,970
Oh, wow.

1452
02:11:53,371 --> 02:11:53,931
Category, yes.

1453
02:11:53,971 --> 02:11:55,272
That is really cool.

1454
02:11:55,773 --> 02:11:56,513
Yes, yes.

1455
02:11:56,694 --> 02:11:59,336
And my daughter also competed with some solos and did five.

1456
02:12:00,301 --> 02:12:06,725
But their team got the highest score a Cambridge Synchro team has ever gotten in a national competition, so.

1457
02:12:06,745 --> 02:12:07,505
That's really neat.

1458
02:12:07,685 --> 02:12:08,886
Well, congratulations to her.

1459
02:12:09,426 --> 02:12:09,726
Thank you.

1460
02:12:09,746 --> 02:12:10,927
It was very exciting.

1461
02:12:12,268 --> 02:12:14,769
OK, so that was our administrative.

1462
02:12:15,529 --> 02:12:17,771
