1466
02:12:23,514 --> 02:12:23,954
Seconded.

1467
02:12:24,975 --> 02:12:25,295
OK.

1468
02:12:25,855 --> 02:12:27,256
All in favor?

1469
02:12:27,276 --> 02:12:28,577
Aye.

1470
02:12:28,597 --> 02:12:28,837
Aye.

1471
02:12:31,117 --> 02:12:31,357
Great.

1472
02:12:32,177 --> 02:12:34,418
