1474
02:12:36,999 --> 02:12:38,519
August 25th?

1475
02:12:40,179 --> 02:12:40,399
Yeah.

1476
02:12:41,140 --> 02:12:41,400
Okay.

1477
02:12:42,120 --> 02:12:42,340
Great.

1478
02:12:43,180 --> 02:12:44,700
I'm going to go plan a vacation.

1479
02:12:44,740 --> 02:12:47,841
I'm going to go plan a vacation for that week right now.

1480
02:12:48,561 --> 02:12:50,122
Just because we're so fun.

1481
02:12:50,182 --> 02:12:51,682
